  "content_en": "After the game, Xia Tian couldn't help but want to choke, but was stopped by Si Mian. She smiled slightly and her attitude was very friendly, \"Sister Siyi, of course we are not here to fight, but I heard that Sister Siyi is good at badminton. I came here to meet Sister Siyi. Isn't the company going to hold a sports meeting recently? I am going to participate in a badminton competition, so I came here to learn from you, Sister Siyi, and please teach me.\" After saying that, she looked at Xiang Siyi with admiring eyes. Xiang Siyi was naturally overjoyed to be flattered like this in public. Seeing Si Mian's sincere attitude and his childlike appearance, Xiang Siyi gradually felt relieved. \"So it's like this. I accidentally stepped on Xia Xia this morning. I thought she had a grudge against me and brought you to settle accounts with me.\" \"Of course not. We are all interns and should love each other. How can there be internal strife? I have heard of Sister Siyi before. She is beautiful and generous. When I saw her today, it was just like the rumors.\" Xia Xia leaned close to her ear, anxious, \"Mianmian, why are you so close to her?\" Si Mian secretly patted her back, signaling her to calm down. In this era, it is no longer fashionable to pull each other's hair and spit when fighting. \"I originally planned to take a lunch break, but seeing that you want to study so much, I'll teach you.\" That tone sounded like a huge sacrifice. Xiang Siyi walked in front, her chin raised high, her hands folded across her chest, and she was extremely proud. All of her friends followed her. Employee Activity Center. \"Sister Siyi, how about the two of us have a fight first, and you can see my level before teaching. Do you think this is okay?\" \"That's fine.\" Xiang Siyi's eyes flashed with a malicious smile. At the beginning, Xiang Siyi seemed to be teasing her on purpose. The balls she served were all high and difficult to catch. Si Mian ran two steps casually, and then accidentally fell to the ground. \"Oh, are you okay?\" Xiang Siyi asked caringly. \"It's okay.\" Si Mian got up. Xia Xia was extremely anxious when she saw them nearby. Today she came to take revenge. Why did she become so aggressive towards Siyi and them? Seeing that she was out of breath and almost falling down from exhaustion, Xiang Siyi smiled with satisfaction, \"How about it, do you still want to learn? I see you are already very tired.\" \"Study, of course you have to learn, let's continue, but this time I will serve first.\" Si Mian bent down to pick up the badminton and weighed it in his hand. Xiang Siyi smiled indifferently and stood there with her badminton racket on her shoulder, not paying attention to Si Mian at all. Seeing her state, Si Mian smiled without trace. When the badminton was sent out, Xiang Siyi caught it and played back and forth with Si Mian two or three times. When he caught it again, she hit it back hard, very fast and at a high height. Xiang Siyi looked like she was ready to finish. But when Si Mian jumped up, caught the ball steadily, and waved back to Siyi hard, Xiang Siyi swung the racket quickly, but her posture and condition were not good. She was obviously caught off guard. She did not expect that Si Mian could catch the ball. Next, Si Mian played easily, standing there waving the racket constantly, but Xiang Siyi started running all over the court, looking very embarrassed. He barely caught the ball many times, and sweat broke out on his forehead. In the end, Xiang Siyi just watched the ball without looking at the ground. She stumbled and fell to the ground. She fell so ugly that her pants were torn. Her legs felt cold, and Xiang Siyi screamed, \"Ah--\" This cry attracted the side glances of the employees nearby, and everyone could see her embarrassment. Si Mian put the racket on his shoulders, smiled, and said coolly, \"Xia Tian, ​​let's go, the game is over.\" Xia Tian was not the only one who had been bullied by Xiang Siyi. Everyone dared to be angry and dare not speak out because of Xiang Siyi's uncle, so when they found out that Si Mian had shaved her off in the activity room, Si Mian's popularity suddenly exploded. For a week, people bought her breakfast, all grateful that she had saved their lives. ..... Gu Mo was inspecting outside when he received a call from the office, saying that his old man was visiting. After inspecting the work, Gu Mo went back and opened the door of the office to hear Gu Qi roaring angrily, \"You unfilial son, do you still have eyes for me as your father? Forget it if you don't go home. I came to you in person, but you made me wait for three hours.\" \"Are you asking me to abandon the large number of people accompanying me and come back to listen to you lecture me?\"",
  "translated": true
